From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gellert <gellert.hegyi@around.co>
Date: Tue, 19 May 2020 13:45:05 +0200
Subject: adds native audio processing

This patch adds custom denoising for around using a custom rnnoise model with support to set different NS levels and also adds events and handlers to process vad state and other audio related states and params inside libwebrtcs audio processing module.

Signed-off-by: gellert <gellert.hegyi@around.co>

